  title: '[L6]Stack Operations and Subroutines'
  content: "Lesson 6: Stack Operations and Subroutines\r\nObjective: Set up and use
    basic subroutines and understand stack management.\r\nInstructions Covered:\r\nCALL:
    Call a subroutine (another block of code).\r\nRET: Return from a subroutine.\r\n\r\nCALL
    mySubroutine\r\n; ...\r\nmySubroutine:\r\n  INC AX\r\n  RET\r\nExercise Application:
    In Exercise 8 (Recursive Raptor), you\u2019ll call a function and return to the
    main program after it executes.\r\n"
